# "Whenever you attack this turn" (CR 603.7b, 508.1m): the delayed ability triggers only when its controller declares
# attackers and only this turn. Bot1 activates the Encampment on turn 4, during Bot2's main phase, and Bot2 attacks with its
# Ornithopter: Bot1 did not attack, so no Warriors. On turn 5 the ability is gone, and Bot1's own attack makes none either
# (the positive control is the scenario in which the same attack follows the activation in the same turn). On turn 3
# Bot1 had declared no attackers at all, which would not have triggered it.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mountain
Dalkovan Encampment
Mox Pearl
Mox Jet
Mox Ruby
Ornithopter
Plains
Plains x14

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mox Ruby
Plains x16

